      "kind": "email",
      "title": "Un fin de semana en York",
      "text": "Hi Emma,\nWe had a weekend away in York. We went by train from London. On Saturday we walked along the city walls. Then we saw the cathedral. It was enormous! We didn't visit the Viking museum. We didn't have time. On Sunday it rained all day, so we sat in a tea room. I bought a souvenir for my grandson.\nLove, Yolanda",
      "questions": [
        {
          "q": "¿Cómo fueron a York?",
          "options": [
            "En tren",
            "En coche",
            "En autocar"
          ],
          "answer": "En tren"
        },
        {
          "q": "¿Qué no visitaron?",
          "options": [
            "El museo vikingo",
            "La catedral",
            "La muralla"
          ],
          "answer": "El museo vikingo"
        },
        {
          "q": "¿Qué hicieron el domingo?",
          "options": [
            "Estuvieron en un salón de té",
            "Pasearon por la muralla",
            "Fueron a la playa"
          ],
          "answer": "Estuvieron en un salón de té"
        }
      ],
      "why": "Fíjate en los pasados: went, saw, sat, bought, y en didn't + verbo base.",
      "g": "en-g-past-did"
    },
